Welcome to the Spectacled beta! Journals, Notes and Tasks are open apps for Android, iOS, Web and Desktop, synced over CalDAV with your own server. No account needed.
• Works with Nextcloud, Radicale and other CalDAV servers
• Categories, attachments and linked entries
• Search and filters
• Works offline, syncs in the background
• Light and dark theme
Please send us your feedback!
